<title>USA: ThrustMaster sets stock dividend.</title>
<headline>ThrustMaster sets stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND ORE. 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>ThrustMaster Inc Tuesday said its board of directors declared a three percent stock dividend payable to shareholders of record on February 14, 1997.</p>
<p>In a statement, ThrustMaster said the shares will trade ex-dividend beginning February 12, 1997.</p>
